opo\" in VR! This app allows you to work on an imaginary (and nonsense) easy job of placing a flower on sashimis. You can play one-minute \"Sashimi Tanpopo\" mode and eternal \"Infinite Tanpopo\" mode.\n\nBoth touch controllers and hand-tracking are supported. Refresh rate 90Hz is also supported on Oculus Quest 2.", "short_description": "You can experience the Japanese internet meme \"Sashimi Tanpopo\" in VR!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "2867269120154805", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_2867269123488138_3321077611508274240_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ETjkI6mwWXkQ7kNvwFImQXJ&_nc_oc=AdnJ9fVUToqfGD5m2TiGaKGTWKZ5Qvew7zxOA1SLpmoRrGMAdGRh7I2MhCpEi35xv_E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs0tywxouxAacGc3wqVv7C18b7esLueDLeoutw3IXfukQ&oe=69A1A81A"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtMiniLandscape.png", "id": "1673107229564288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974703_1673107236230954_2300899480350089191_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=62jHacEC8pIQ7kNvwEVXCrx&_nc_oc=AdkEPQ7G0fW4uswH9UW_QZslmB55TQIQOMKhmW4ek2rjFG50db-ip9roMh7GHGivUrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu6JatxAJb2wA4hj8mgaOGE-_Pp2O63KacuY63Ipco3QQ&oe=69A19E47"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "799405117646180", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974454_799405120979513_1375710005646570479_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h9kjzpFaPBkQ7kNvwGjaa_U&_nc_oc=AdnB3cL1eB3dtPv-NcQ_JnnpcuvofzIG-p7YwbxsOkxxJ-sZIDeIbkrEqR8adxXHiwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs0ILdK0Tysd5ccl3X_kdMy0GRsZpDKNBYp4Cfn2polzg&oe=69A180FC"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtSquare.png", "id": "462919248108982", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/